! Venting (NCSTAR Table 5-6). In FDS 6.10.1 an &OBST with DEVC_ID exists while its device is true, so the
! timers that carry leaves and windows start TRUE (present at t = 0, removed at the setpoint); the timers
! that carry the exit &HOLEs start FALSE (shut at t = 0, cut at the setpoint).
&DEVC ID='TIMER_029', QUANTITY='TIME', XYZ=0,0,1, SETPOINT=29.0, INITIAL_STATE=.TRUE. /
